# Getting started

## Prerequisites

- Python {{ python_version }} or later

## Installation

{% if package_manager == 'uv' %}
Run `uv sync --locked` to create a virtual environment and install dependencies.
{% elif package_manager == 'python-env' %}
Create a virtual environment and install the development requirements:

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
```
{% elif package_manager == 'pixi' %}
Run `pixi install` to set up the environment.
{% endif %}

## Running the application

{% if use_cli %}
```bash
python -m {{ package_name }}
```
{% else %}
The project does not include a CLI. Use it as a library.
{% endif %}